DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI NotificationsAuditLogPage shipped at parity with the web source:
a pure @Observable state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing the list state
(loading / empty / error / success) and the client-side search box over an injectable
NotificationsAuditLogDataSource seam whose AuditLogEntry value type mirrors the web AuditLogEntry
1:1 (production binds the shared KMP `/system/audit` client — web `useAuditLogs` — through the
seam). The page reproduces the web chrome (PageContainer title + subtitle) and the single
"Recent Activity" GlassPanel whose body switches across the web states: a 5-row loading skeleton,
an empty "No audit entries found", an error ("Failed to load audit logs" + verbatim detail +
Retry), and the success branch — a SearchInput + removable active-filter chip over an adaptive
four-column DataTable (Time / Action / Resource / Details: columnar grid on macOS/iPad, per-row
cards on iPhone) with the web "no matches" message when the search filters everything out — using
the P2 tokens + P3 shared components (no hand-rolled glass). Every visible string resolves from
Localizable.xcstrings with the web key names (13 keys); the timestamp + substring search are
ported from dateFormat.ts + useFilteredList and unit-tested. A dedicated `.notificationsAudit`
route (pathSegment `notifications/audit`, Operations group) + parser alias + registration make it
sidebar-reachable and `/notifications/audit` deep-linkable, preserving every RouteTests invariant
(verified by the route harness). Verified on BOTH idioms by isolated Swift 6 strict-concurrency
type-checks (macOS 0/0 + iOS 0/0, incl. previews + the compact branch) and executed model + route
harnesses (all assertions passed). The full xcodebuild scheme is RED ONLY due to a pre-existing,
out-of-scope failure of the KMP Shared.xcframework Gradle staging phase (daemon stopped / OOM-kill
under parallel-slot contention; ZERO Swift diagnostics, ZERO in my files; forbidden to commit-fix),
